  "releaseNotes": "- **The endpoint catalog no longer has a `LockHolderDescription` column:** the holder of an endpoint's process lock records itself in the domain database's `DatabaseProcessLockHolder` table, as every holder of the domain database's process locks does. An existing database keeps the column, which nothing writes any more.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Tessaging 0.12.1-alpha (was 0.11.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
